to the EU/EEA and does not take place in third countries. AKI.IO does not use hyperscaler
infrastructure for inference."* Zero-retention claimed: *"Prompts, inputs, and generated outputs
are processed in volatile memory and are not logged, stored, or analyzed."* Art. 28 GDPR DPA on
company-account setup; § 203 StGB professional-secrecy addendum available. Certifications are
attributed carefully — *"ISO 27001, TÜVIT TSI, DIN EN 50600 and other certifications apply to the
respective data center operators"*, i.e. to the DC operators, not to AKI.IO. The Privacy Policy
(lastmod 2026-06-26) scopes the EU guarantee to inference only: *"certain third-party services may
involve transfers of personal data to countries outside the EEA, including the United States"*
(Google/LinkedIn Ads, Google/GitHub SSO). Controller AKI.IO GmbH, Berlin. B2B only.

